  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "TRIAL EDITION - SQL longer than 10,000 characters is rejected (parse() returns -1). Full edition: https://www.sqlparser.com\n\nRelease 4.1.0.19\n\n- [Oracle] Accept DEFAULT ... ON CONVERSION ERROR in TO_DATE,\n  TO_NUMBER, TO_TIMESTAMP and the other conversion functions\n  (Mantis 5121).\n- [Oracle] Accept VALIDATE_CONVERSION(expr AS type [, fmt])\n  (Mantis 5136). VALIDATE_CONVERSION is now a keyword: an unqualified\n  column with that name no longer parses; qualify it (t.col_name).\n- [resolver2] Resolve columns inside TRIM, CONVERT and\n  SUBSTRING ... FOR, e.g. t1.status in TRIM(t1.status) (Mantis 5127).\n- [Oracle] DataFlowAnalyzer runs the C# port of the Java Oracle\n  lineage implementation.\n- [MSSQL] Lineage resolves statement scope, aliases and table hints\n  the same way as Java, and traces CTE references and table-valued\n  function arguments in FROM and CROSS APPLY.\n\nDemos: https://github.com/sqlparser/gsp_demo_dotnet",
